cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this software, cite the repository and record the exact commit used. See REUSE.md for reuse permissions."
type: software
title: "OSTOSENSE AI: Ordinal Classification for Experimental Ostomy Monitoring"
authors:
  - name: "OSTOSENSE contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rsyarsya/OSTOSENSE-AI"
url: "https://github.com/rsyarsya/OSTOSENSE-AI"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype providing deterministic sensor-data processing,
  synthetic ordinal classification experiments, portable C++ inference,
  and versioned application interfaces. The bundled model is trained on
  synthetic data and has not been validated for clinical use.
keywords:
  - ostomy monitoring
  - ordinal logistic regression
  - capacitive sensing
  - reproducible research
  - embedded inference
